{"3063690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "KYRO", "steam_appid": 3063690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the edge of the universe. <strong>KYRO</strong> is a top-down, pixel art action-adventure where exploration meets heartfelt storytelling. Step into the shoes of Aiden, a courageous boy doing his best to help others on the Island of Ka'a—the final piece of a shattered world floating on the event horizon of a black hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063690/extras/4542502e67ca585f7254c2ddc02274c2.poster.avif?t=1781663957\" width=34 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063690/extras/4542502e67ca585f7254c2ddc02274c2.webm?t=1781663957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> Your journey will take you through mysterious ruins and clever puzzles. To get by, you'll rely on your trusty slingshot and a tactical pocket arsenal of different ammo types. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between your expeditions, you'll assist the colorful folks of Vila Carnaval. These resilient survivors know the apocalypse is knocking, but they’ve chosen laughter over despair, living out their days in endless celebration and party costumes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063690/extras/5aabc01b9002c6b30da52dd57c18aa8a.avif?t=1781663957\" width=240 height=64 /></span>Will you unravel the secrets of Ka'a and bring hope to your new friends?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the edge of the universe. <strong>KYRO</strong> is a top-down, pixel art action-adventure where exploration meets heartfelt storytelling. Step into the shoes of Aiden, a courageous boy doing his best to help others on the Island of Ka'a—the final piece of a shattered world floating on the event horizon of a black hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063690/extras/4542502e67ca585f7254c2ddc02274c2.poster.avif?t=1781663957\" width=34 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063690/extras/4542502e67ca585f7254c2ddc02274c2.webm?t=1781663957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> Your journey will take you through mysterious ruins and clever puzzles. To get by, you'll rely on your trusty slingshot and a tactical pocket arsenal of different ammo types. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between your expeditions, you'll assist the colorful folks of Vila Carnaval. These resilient survivors know the apocalypse is knocking, but they’ve chosen laughter over despair, living out their days in endless celebration and party costumes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063690/extras/5aabc01b9002c6b30da52dd57c18aa8a.avif?t=1781663957\" width=240 height=64 /></span>Will you unravel the secrets of Ka'a and bring hope to your new friends?</p>", "short_description": "KYRO is a top-down pixel art action-adventure. Play as Aiden, a boy with a trusty slingshot, exploring Ka'a on the edge of a black hole. Solve puzzles, uncover ruins, and help the people of Vila Carnaval face the apocalypse with laughter and party costumes!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Filipino, German, Japanese, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://sh